     dis[v]=dis[u]+w;\n                    pq.insert(make_pair(dis[v],v));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        for(int i=1;i<=all;i++) tag[i]=min(tag[i]+dis[i],winf);\n        if(!vis[s]) return false;\n        for(int i=1;i<=all;i++) vis[i]=false;\n        return true;\n    }\n    int dfs(int u,int t,int fl)\n    {\n        if(u==t || !fl) return fl;\n        int res=0;\n        vis[u]=true;\n        for(int &i=cur[u];i;i=r[i].nxt)\n        if(r[i].f)\n        {\n            int v=r[i].to,f;\n            if(!vis[v] && tag[v]+r[i].w==tag[u] && (f=dfs(v,t,min(fl,r[i].f))))\n            {\n                r[i].f-=f,r[i^1].f+=f;\n                res+=f,fl-=f;\n                if(!fl) break;\n            }\n        }\n        vis[u]=false;\n        return res;\n    }\n    int maxf;typ minw;\n    void work(int s,int t){while(dij(s,t)){int w=dfs(s,t,inf);maxf+=w,minw+=w*tag[s];}}\n}\nint ss=1,tt=2,n,m,k,c,d;\nvector<int>g[N];\ninline int id(int t,int x){return t*n+x+2;}\nvoid work(int t)\n{\n    all+=n;\n    for(int u=1;u<=n;u++)\n        for(int v:g[u])\n        {\n            for(int p=1;p<=k;p++)\n            add(id(t,u),id(t+1,v),1,d*(2*p-1));\n        }\n    for(int u=1;u<=n;u++) add(id(t,u),id(t+1,u),inf,0);\n    add(id(t+1,1),tt,inf,c*(t+1));\n}\nint main()\n{\n    scanf(\"%d%d%d%d%d\",&n,&m,&k,&c,&d);\n    all=n+2;\n    for(int i=1;i<=k;i++)\n    {\n        int a;\n        scanf(\"%d\",&a);\n        add(ss,id(0,a),1,0);\n    }\n    for(int i=1;i<=m;i++)\n    {\n        int u,v;\n        scanf(\"%d%d\",&u,&v);\n        g[u].push_back(v);g[v].push_back(u);\n    }\n    add(id(0,1),tt,inf,0);\n    for(int i=0;i<=n+k;i++) work(i);\n    min_cost_flow::work(ss,tt);\n    printf(\"%d\\n\",min_cost_flow::minw);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int MAXN = 100010;\n    static final int MAXM = 1000010;\n    static final int INF = 1000000000;\n    static final int WIN = 1000000000;\n\n    static int[] head = new int[MAXN];\n    static int[] nxt = new int[2 * MAXM];\n    static int[] to = new int[2 * MAXM];\n    static int[] f = new int[2 * MAXM];\n    static int[] w = new int[2 * MAXM];\n    static int cnt = 1;\n\n    static int all;\n    static int ss = 1, tt = 2;\n    static int n, m, k, c, d;\n    static List<Integer>[] g;\n\n    static int[] cur = new int[MAXN];\n    static boolean[] vis = new boolean[MAXN];\n    static int[] dis = new int[MAXN];\n    static int[] tag = new int[MAXN];\n    static int maxf, minw;\n\n    static void addEdge(int u, int v, int cap, int cost) {\n        cnt++;\n        nxt[cnt] = head[u];\n        to[cnt] = v;\n        f[cnt] = cap;\n        w[cnt] = cost;\n        head[u] = cnt;\n\n        cnt++;\n        nxt[cnt] = head[v];\n        to[cnt] = u;\n        f[cnt] = 0;\n        w[cnt] = -cost;\n        head[v] = cnt;\n    }\n\n    static boolean dij(int s, int t) {\n        for (int i = 1; i <= all; i++) {\n            dis[i] = WIN;\n            cur[i] = head[i];\n        }\n        dis[t] = 0;\n        PriorityQueue<int[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Comparator.comparingInt(a -> a[0]));\n        pq.offer(new int[]{0, t});\n        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n            int[] curP = pq.poll();\n            int u = curP[1];\n            if (vis[u]) continue;\n            vis[u] = true;\n            for (int i = head[u]; i != 0; i = nxt[i]) {\n                int v = to[i];\n                int wgt = tag[u] + w[i ^ 1] - tag[v];\n                if (f[i ^ 1] > 0 && dis[u] + wgt < dis[v]) {\n                    dis[v] = dis[u] + wgt;\n                    pq.offer(new int[]{dis[v], v});\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i <= all; i++) {\n            tag[i] = Math.min(tag[i] + dis[i], WIN);\n        }\n        if (!vis[s]) return false;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= all; i++) vis[i] = false;\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    static int dfs(int u, int t, int fl) {\n        if (u == t || fl == 0) return fl;\n        int res = 0;\n        vis[u] = true;\n        for (int i = cur[u]; i != 0; i = nxt[i]) {\n            cur[u] = i;\n            if (f[i] > 0) {\n                int v = to[i];\n                if (!vis[v] && tag[v] + w[i] == tag[u]) {\n                    int f2 = dfs(v, t, Math.min(fl, f[i]));\n                    if (f2 > 0) {\n                        f[i] -= f2;\n                        f[i ^ 1] += f2;\n                        res += f2;\n                        fl -= f2;\n                        if (fl == 0) break;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        vis[u] = false;\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    static void work(int t) {\n        all += n;\n        for (int u = 1; u <= n; u++) {\n            for (int v : g[u]) {\n                for (int p = 1; p <= k; p++) {\n                    addEdge(id(t, u), id(t + 1, v), 1, d * (2 * p - 1));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        for (int u = 1; u <= n; u++) {\n            addEdge(id(t, u), id(t + 1, u), INF, 0);\n        }\n        addEdge(id(t + 1, 1), tt, INF, c * (t + 1));\n    }\n\n    static int id(int t, int x) {\n        return t * n + x + 2;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        n = sc.nextInt();\n        m = sc.nextInt();\n        k = sc.nextInt();\n        c = sc.nextInt();\n        d = sc.nextInt();\n        all = n + 2;\n        g = new ArrayList[n + 1];\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) g[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (int i = 1; i <= k; i++) {\n            int a = sc.nextInt();\n            addEdge(ss, id(0, a), 1, 0);\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n            int u = sc.nextInt();\n            int v = sc.nextInt();\n            g[u].add(v);\n            g[v].add(u);\n        }\n        addEdge(id(0, 1), tt, INF, 0);\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n + k; i++) work(i);\n        min_cost_flow();\n        System.out.println(minw);\n    }\n\n    static void min_cost_flow() {\n        while (dij(ss, tt)) {\n            int w = dfs(ss, tt, INF);\n            maxf += w;\n            minw += w * tag[ss];\n        }\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.1280079036951065, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00017069313616957515, -0.005248458590358496, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.00020346954988781363, -0.002810340141877532, -0.00010680581908673048, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00019131260341964662, -0.0005694198189303279, -1.3112935448589269e-05, -0.00022110878489911556, -0.0002488780301064253, 0.0, -0.06338813900947571, -0.00020549570035655051, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0009490515221841633, -4.529942543740617e-06, -0.000316212244797498, 0.0, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0001245659514097497, -1.5497195136049413e-06, 0.0, -0.0004822045157197863, -0.0011704268399626017, -6.318072337307967e-06, -0.2014152854681015, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.00010764019680209458, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -1.4424220353248529e-05, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.622600959512056e-06, -0.0001864259538706392, -3.540453326422721e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -7.486063259420916e-05, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0011876918142661452, -3.838465272565372e-05, -0.0015026956098154187, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.887569048150908e-06, -0.3916025459766388, 0.0, -0.00026127262390218675, -0.00043132537393830717, -0.007260958198457956, -3.814689989667386e-06, -1.5497195136049413e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -2.861018856492592e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.4543427823809907e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.7881233361549675e-05, -0.011182964779436588, 0.0, -1.3113